{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "bcf2a482-1d00-5993-8c65-0935b5499f25", "source_ordinal": 587, "reading_ordinal": 3470, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "开窍", "published_at": "2025-09-07T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/2e2d069685d111f0954c52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "开窍就是明白一件事为什么要做，明白它的目的和价值。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "明白目的和价值，你才会自己产生一系列的价值标准，定义什么叫“这事办得好”。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "比如我在厨房里喊一声“快，帮我拿点纸来！”", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "我只有时间喊这么一声，你冲出去拿什么纸？", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 106}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "是包装箱纸壳子，还是一张报纸？还是一张海报纸？还是一卷卫生纸？", "char_start": 107, "char_end": 138}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我在厨房里喊，我估计是要什么纸？我多半要的是可以去污、吸水或隔热的纸。", "char_start": 139, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你拿了一张海报来，或者撕了一块包装纸箱来，我不能说你做错了，因为我知道我的确只给了你这么点信息，按我给的这个信息，你其实谈不上做得有什么错。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "海报纸不也是纸？瓦楞纸不也是纸？你做错了吗？", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "严格说是没有的。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "但我会发现你在执行指令的时候不会先建立“怎么做才算优秀、怎么算及格、怎么算失败”的标准，没有算上这么一算。", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "但到这里算是“不开窍”吗？", "char_start": 332, "char_end": 345}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "算，但还不致命。因为年轻人、菜鸟经常犯这种错误。我如果坚决不接受，那能给我干活的人就太少了，我要招人的成本就会过高。", "char_start": 346, "char_end": 404}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "致命的是我告诉你我要的不是报纸，是能吸水去污的纸的时候，你说“你又没说”“不早说”，而不是一拍大腿“哎呀呀，对呀，我下次注意 / 我应该想到的”。", "char_start": 405, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为这意味着你不但没开窍，而且想等到你开窍非常难。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 504}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "人毕竟要的是一个做得成、做得好事的人，而不是一个“虽然办不成事但确实没责任”的人。", "char_start": 505, "char_end": 546}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "给你下指令要八百多字，而且只要心怀侥幸省了一句话，你必在这句话上犯一个“你又不早说”的错，这样的苦活没人想干，你明白吗？", "char_start": 547, "char_end": 607}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这就是所谓的“窍”，不开没责任，只不过就是工作会比较难找而又比较容易丢。", "char_start": 608, "char_end": 644}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "就是这样，你掂量吧。", "char_start": 645, "char_end": 655}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0498"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：领导说他喜欢跟「开窍」的人打交道。那么什么样的人算是「开窍」了呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“开窍”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“开窍就是明白一件事为什么要做，明白它的目的和价值。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "开窍就是明白一件事为什么要做，明白它的目的和价值。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "951e524d-6eab-50ae-8d22-f39398a118bc", "source_ordinal": 586, "reading_ordinal": 3471, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "早知道", "published_at": "2025-09-08T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/170ae21486b011f0b4cc52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是在进行一种自我表白，即当前糟糕的结果、惨痛的损失，其原因不是出于我的道德问题、伦理缺憾，而是因为人类固有的认知问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "换言之，是一种“无责任错误”，一种无心的过失。", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "人非圣贤，岂有生而知之者？", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "人非神明，岂有无所不知者？", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "所以仅仅出于无知、未知、知不及时、知而不尽、知而未信，无涉于任何良知、义理上的错误，本质上没有可追究的责任。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 167}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我如果早知道你是在给病人做紧急开胸手术，我就不会打你。但我彼时不知道，我的眼里你就是正在行凶的凶手，所以我情急之下对你开枪，打断了你的手。结果是惨烈的，但这是我不知情造成的问题，你要自认倒霉/放弃责怪。", "char_start": 168, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "我如果早知道考试会这样考，我就会这样复习，所以我没考好不是我的学习态度问题，而是人不能先知先觉的问题。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "简单来说，这是为了脱罪、免责、避怨。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果你要反对这个做法，你可以从对方的前提假设问起：", "char_start": 341, "char_end": 366}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你觉得我是在杀人，那么你有枪在手，为什么不大喝一声“不许动，警察”？按照你的法定程序，你为什么不先亮明身份并先警告射击？如果你尊重程序，你就有机会知道，就不存在“早知如此”这种问题，你要如何解释你的失职？", "char_start": 367, "char_end": 469}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你说你不知道考试要考这个，那么考前复习阶段老师划考试范围时你在不在场？这节课你听了没有？隔壁左右的同学在复习什么、背诵什么，你难道没有听到？", "char_start": 470, "char_end": 540}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你只是现在要拿这张免罪卡，所以要装这个糊涂罢了。", "char_start": 541, "char_end": 565}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "另外，你其实用不着拿这些理由来解释你是不是故意的，因为现在开给你的罚单根本就没有按照你是故意的来额外重罚，而是一开始就是按照你实际是无意的，要你赔偿非故意造成的损失而已。", "char_start": 567, "char_end": 652}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "难道你说句“非故意”，就对你造成的损失不承担任何赔偿责任了？", "char_start": 653, "char_end": 683}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "那是对你自己的父母才存在的特殊豁免条款——因为当你是小孩子时，你的父母教你承担责任是没有意义的，反正罚金还是ta们自己出，所以父母专一的只追究故意情节，对故意情节施以肉体或精神的惩戒。", "char_start": 684, "char_end": 776}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "现在你不是在对你的父母，你是在对你自己（例如没考好），是在对别人（例如误伤医生）。", "char_start": 777, "char_end": 818}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "对你自己，你解释也没用，因为后果已经发生，你反正是没考及格。你要找借口自我开脱，你只是在增加再次不及格的概率。", "char_start": 819, "char_end": 874}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "对别人，你解释不解释，都要赔这个数。解释了一样要赔。人家本来就没按你故意来开罚单，你进一步的主张不故意只是在耽误人的时间、浪费人的心情——怎么，这意思是这个罚单你都要赖？", "char_start": 875, "char_end": 960}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这是在把小孩在家的习惯强行往社会上套。", "char_start": 961, "char_end": 980}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "以后不要干这种无谓的事了。", "char_start": 981, "char_end": 994}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0498"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待事后的“早知道”这种态度？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“早知道”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是在进行一种自我表白，即当前糟糕的结果、惨痛的损失，其原因不是出于我的道德问题、伦理缺憾，而是因为人类固有的认知问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是在进行一种自我表白，即当前糟糕的结果、惨痛的损失，其原因不是出于我的道德问题、伦理缺憾，而是因为人类固有的认知问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 60, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "baee5907-7449-5c41-945a-1b3bd15cd2e6", "source_ordinal": 585, "reading_ordinal": 3472, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "岂曰无恩", "published_at": "2025-09-09T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/6e88e3a0871511f09a615254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "只要你认识到张三对你好，你就要想办法回报这个好，这跟其他一切因素都无关。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "举点例子，张三杀了李四的老爹，现在李四要来找张三复仇，张三对你好，你义理上虽然不能帮ta打李四，你也至少可以帮张三照顾子女、及时送医。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "有恩必报，这是做人最基本的道理，跟其他一切的义理都不矛盾。哪怕你的恩人犯了再大的罪，你只不过是不能用帮忙脱罪来报恩而已，但除了这条，可报答的手段多了去了，“恩人有罪”不构成有恩不报的合理理由——更不谈“有恩不认”这么无廉耻的行为了。", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "有这么一类人，受了人的恩，听到了有关自己的恩人的风言风语，立刻迫不及待的倒戈相向。", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "本来受人恩惠的人遇到这类东西，哪怕是仅仅出于礼仪、出于基本人性，也有天然的、不可推卸的义务要对这些不利传言做最严谨的怀疑，这是受人恩惠应该承担的最起码的礼仪要求。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 345}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "如果你受了人恩惠，轻信那些指控倒戈相向，回头来却被人三言两语问住，揭穿了你根本没做基本怀疑的事实，你在这个世界上的信用就会毁灭殆尽。", "char_start": 346, "char_end": 412}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "因为这实际证明了你就是农夫怀里的那条蛇，是那种“为了不必报恩会找借口先把恩人消灭”的人。", "char_start": 413, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "人对你的怜悯和帮助，反而成为ta自身的诅咒。", "char_start": 458, "char_end": 480}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "一旦这一点被证实，你在所有见证者眼里就成了“不可接触的人”。谁敢搭你茬？谁敢帮你忙？谁敢救你命？", "char_start": 481, "char_end": 529}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果有一个知情人，发现你听了别人说张三不好就不认张三对你的恩情，那么哪怕这人自己就是说不好的人之一，都在内心深处觉得你不是个好东西，暗自警惕不要跟你沾边。", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 607}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "张三于你有恩你都这样，我一路人，何德何能敢期待更好的待遇？", "char_start": 608, "char_end": 637}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "比起你不欠债的陌生人，你反倒会优先消灭恩人，不帮忙、不救命，反而不至于上你的黑名单。", "char_start": 638, "char_end": 680}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你要落下这么一个名声，你这辈子恐怕难过得很了。", "char_start": 681, "char_end": 704}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "所以这个问题有非常清晰的答案——你非认不可。", "char_start": 705, "char_end": 727}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "有恩必报，岂能不认？认都不认，谈何“必报”？", "char_start": 728, "char_end": 750}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "有罪的恩人仍然是恩人，如果你推翻这条原则，“只要给恩人定罪就可以免除报恩义务”的福利就会引诱你干蠢事，进而被人普遍唾弃。", "char_start": 751, "char_end": 811}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "说白了，天理不容——自然法不批准。", "char_start": 812, "char_end": 829}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "自己小心吧。", "char_start": 830, "char_end": 836}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0498"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：有一个人别人都说他不好，但他对你好，那你认不认他的好?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“岂曰无恩”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“只要你认识到张三对你好，你就要想办法回报这个好，这跟其他一切因素都无关。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "只要你认识到张三对你好，你就要想办法回报这个好，这跟其他一切因素都无关。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "08008b3b-404a-574f-83d3-7083f6cda1d5", "source_ordinal": 584, "reading_ordinal": 3473, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "掂", "published_at": "2025-09-10T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/1a18648c880d11f0b45e5254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "解决问题的能力包括以下要素：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）定义问题的能力。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如何判定存在这样的一个问题？这个问题有几种特征表现？有哪些与之相似然而本质不同的近似物？", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这一步，基本等于为一个问题制定“诊断指引”。基于这一系列的判定标准来判定问题的存在，并对这个问题进行命名。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 124}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个约等于收集完身份信息、生物特征后给这个问题发了一个身份证、开了一个账号。这样关于这个问题的一切事务都可以记录在这个账号里。", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "2）构建预警机制的能力。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这包括两个方面，一个是检验手法，一个是制度安排。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 227}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "比如电梯跌落事故，检验方式是测量缆绳的磨损程度和卡钳的完好程度，而制度安排就是每个月都要安排专业人员去上门检测并登记维护记录。", "char_start": 228, "char_end": 291}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "又比如漏水事故，检验方法是在低处放置浸水传感器，同时传感器连接到网络，通过app与专职负责小组沟通，可以发出低电量警告和探测到浸水的提示，而且是同时发给几个共同负责人，以防唯一的负责人因疏忽或睡眠错过警报。", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "又比如煤气泄露问题，在液化天然气里添加臭味物质就是一种“识别问题”的机制，只不过这个制度安排是闻到煤气味的当事人自己负责。", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "3）预防问题的能力。", "char_start": 458, "char_end": 468}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这是指采取必要措施直接抑制问题发生概率的能力。", "char_start": 469, "char_end": 492}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "同样以煤气泄露为例，选用什么样的管道材质和施工工艺来抵抗气候和化学物质侵蚀？如何抗机械损伤？如何制定工程规范来防止管道泄露甚至爆炸？", "char_start": 493, "char_end": 559}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "4）控制问题危害的能力。", "char_start": 560, "char_end": 572}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "还是以煤气泄露为例。设计和铺设消防喷淋系统、自动火警系统就是一种控制问题危害的安排。开展消防训练、普及灭火常识、准备灭火器材，也是这类手段。", "char_start": 573, "char_end": 643}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "出了事，你有没有能力及时反应，遏制事态发展、管控危害范围？", "char_start": 644, "char_end": 673}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "5）弥补损失的能力。", "char_start": 674, "char_end": 684}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "事情已经出了，该烧的已经烧了，伤的已经伤了，死的已经死了，你有没有重建、医治、抚恤的能力？", "char_start": 685, "char_end": 730}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "6）管理成本的能力。", "char_start": 732, "char_end": 742}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "对待一个问题，在完成上述所有建设的前提下，你付出的总成本要比放任这个问题发作造成的损失小。", "char_start": 743, "char_end": 788}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "事实上，只有针对一个破坏性现象所采取的研究、监控、预防、遏止、弥补手段的成本之和小于该现象的危害之和的时候，这一现象才可以被定义为一个问题（problem）。", "char_start": 789, "char_end": 868}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "换言之，所谓的发现问题的能力不是指发现痛苦、危害的能力，而是在发现痛苦和危害之后同时发现了足以经济的预警、预防、遏止、弥补的系列手段，然后才能称其为“发现了一个问题”。", "char_start": 869, "char_end": 953}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "面对危害，能设计并实施一个经济的方法，同时实现长期预警、事前预防、事中遏止、事后弥补，这就叫“解决问题的能力”。", "char_start": 954, "char_end": 1010}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这就是正确答案，不必别寻了。", "char_start": 1011, "char_end": 1025}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0498"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：什么才是真正的“解决问题的能力”?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“掂”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“解决问题的能力包括以下要素：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "解决问题的能力包括以下要素：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "672765a3-30c8-503c-86e3-61c261f08316", "source_ordinal": 583, "reading_ordinal": 3474, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "第三出路", "published_at": "2025-09-11T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/50e475ba890611f0aa8d52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是因为你太注目于自身了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "人在和别人聊天交往的时候基本上只有三个流派。", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一个是聊自己。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "聊自己最近有什么遭遇了，有什么打算了，有什么困扰了，有什么成绩了，有什么机会了，有什么担忧了……", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这也包括聊自己的车、自己的宠物、自己的房子，自己的娃、自己的配偶、自己的亲戚、自己的朋友、自己的敌人……", "char_start": 94, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一个是聊对方。", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这基本上是在聊前面的一切，只是把宾语改一下，从自己改成对方。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "一个是聊世界。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "聊最近有什么新发现了，哪里出什么新鲜事了，又有什么新闻了，农业如何了，工业如何了，政策如何了，经济如何了，环境如何了，动物如何了，植物如何了……", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这其中，只有总是下意识的与人聊第三种天的人会自然而然的保持对世间万物的好奇心。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 309}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "因为这个好奇心就是驱使这人去“进货”的原动力。", "char_start": 310, "char_end": 333}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "没有这些存货，那这天没法聊了，那就真的只能聊你的遭遇、打算、困扰、成绩、机会、担忧……和你的车、宠物、房子、娃、配偶、亲戚、朋友、敌人……了。", "char_start": 334, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "想想都汗毛直竖——聊这些就是近乎无穷尽的礼貌性认同、同情、安慰、理解、倾听……", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 445}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "无限的重复重复再重复。", "char_start": 446, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "最可怕的就是前两类人凑成一局，你听我说我，然后一二三木头人，换我听你说你。", "char_start": 458, "char_end": 495}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "但一旦你走第三条路线，你越是喜欢和人交往，你就越会自然而然的产生对世间万物的兴趣。", "char_start": 496, "char_end": 537}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "因为你提供给人的爱，就是在听了对方的各种需求之后，从你所知道和掌握的自然之中取出一小块来，放在对方面前。而且你这样做了之后，并不需要对方反过来听你说你自己。", "char_start": 538, "char_end": 616}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这样就很容易踏入正循环——对方乐意和你交往，因为总有所得；而你却不是拿出自己的东西来给予，而是从无穷的自然里拿出一块来转赠。", "char_start": 617, "char_end": 679}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这样你就可以轻松的保持对世间万物的好奇。", "char_start": 680, "char_end": 700}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "父母要及早引导子女走上这第三条道路，因为这是一条——甚至可以说是唯一的——出路。", "char_start": 701, "char_end": 741}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0498"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何长久的保持对世间万物的好奇心？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“第三出路”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是因为你太注目于自身了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是因为你太注目于自身了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8473663a-12f7-5171-8859-da815ef9f22a", "source_ordinal": 582, "reading_ordinal": 3475, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "寡欲", "published_at": "2025-09-12T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/0fdd52be89cc11f08bda52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "中国夫妇——甚至可以说中国人——在性方面长期活跃、有旺盛需求其实是很罕见的，尤其是在中国，这差不多是凤毛麟角的现象。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "基本上大家都默认了三四十岁就逐渐淡化了这些需求，而转向个人事业、家庭责任和家族财富方面的追求了。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 107}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "中国文化对生育、抚养看得重，但其实对性欲本身看得非常轻，这在诸多文化中算是不大不小的异类。", "char_start": 108, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "性因为强烈的生理快感问题，一向是原始宗教注目的中心，越是自然崇拜的原始信仰越是强调性的核心地位，其文化、祭仪，乃至社会生活中会有大量的性痕迹。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 225}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这说穿了是因为这个阶段的人类——即人均寿命不超过三十岁的时期——解决一切问题的基本方法都是多生小孩。", "char_start": 226, "char_end": 276}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "没人种地，多生。", "char_start": 277, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "没人防卫，多生。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "遇到灾害，多生。", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "死得太快，一旦生跟不上，转眼就是亡族灭种的大祸。人就是第一生产力，也是第一生产资料。", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 346}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "生生生，赶快生，不择一切手段、不计一切代价的生。这其实就是吴哥窟浮雕、巴厘岛艺术、印度林伽、日本金势神等等信仰现象的根源。", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "但一旦技术水平有所提升，社会的生产力、战斗力不但依赖人口，而且极端的依赖严密的社会组织（如军纪、刑法、税赋）和复杂的技术（如锻造、水利、建筑），这个事的逻辑就变了。", "char_start": 409, "char_end": 491}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "那种狂暴的、不分青红皂白的性欲发作就不再总是社会的推动力量，而在很多时候都会成为社会的阻碍。", "char_start": 492, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "一个很显然的事实是——社会成员在全生命周期内始终以性和生育为主题，绝不如“社会成员一旦过了最佳生育年龄就转而投身社会义务，去教导、守卫、建造而不是继续追逐性快感、争夺性资源”来得更有效率。", "char_start": 539, "char_end": 633}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因此，一个与这个阶段的社会相匹配的意识形态、国教信仰，就自然而然的要做出某种设计来消除育龄之后的社会成员的性冲动。", "char_start": 634, "char_end": 691}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "亚伯拉罕诸教是反欲路线，直接将性欲彻底罪化，将无欲、天阉视为神圣的幸运。", "char_start": 692, "char_end": 728}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "quote", "index": 16, "text": "门徒对耶稣说：“人和妻子既是这样，倒不如不娶。”耶稣说：“这话不是人都能领受的，惟独赐给谁，谁才能领受。因为有生来是阉人，也有被人阉的，并有为天国的缘故自阉的。这话谁能领受就可以领受。”(马太福音 19:10-12 和合本)", "char_start": 729, "char_end": 841}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这意思是如果你天生没有性欲，其实这是一种受祝福的表现。你如果没有这种天赋，你还是不要勉强硬撑，还是该结婚就结婚。", "char_start": 842, "char_end": 898}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而中国走的是将性欲耻化的路线。简单来说，就是认为无法克制、沉迷性欲的人还是一种没有完全成熟的人，不能托付、不能委以重任、不能授予公职，也不能拥有崇高社会地位。", "char_start": 900, "char_end": 979}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这个处理非常微妙——因为这种“惩罚”刚好对年轻人无效。二十岁上下的年轻人本来就被视为不成熟的人，被认为不能托付、不能重任，不会被授予什么公职，更谈不上多高的社会地位。", "char_start": 980, "char_end": 1063}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因此二十岁上下的青年男女实际上是被默许性活跃的，这很好的解决了“无后为大”的问题。", "char_start": 1064, "char_end": 1105}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "但一旦上了三十岁，除非你不要事业前途、社会地位，否则你必须收起你对性的渴望——就算你有，你也要自己管理起来，不要拿出来显露宣扬，否则就是行为不检，德不配位。", "char_start": 1106, "char_end": 1184}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这个就是中国文化对性问题的系统方案——青春期网开一面，许你人不风流枉少年，过了青春期，你就要束发正冠，先天下之忧而忧，为子孙计，为天下谋，鞠躬尽瘁、死而后已。", "char_start": 1185, "char_end": 1264}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "青春期你是人，而一旦你做了家主，你就是后代子孙的祖宗。祖、宗，都是“示”字部的。", "char_start": 1265, "char_end": 1305}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "带示字边的是神。", "char_start": 1306, "char_end": 1314}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "神是完美无缺的道德模范，是无我无畏的智勇化身，性这种兽性之事，自然就泯灭了。", "char_start": 1315, "char_end": 1353}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这个安排，内嵌在中国整个文字语言之中，溶解在诗词歌赋里，铸造在历史、文学里，从你学会说汉语、写中文、背成语、看三国水浒西游红楼时已经写进了你的底层意识。", "char_start": 1354, "char_end": 1430}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这会让你在三四十岁之后——尤其是生育子女之后——急剧的、难以抗拒的性欲消退，飞速的向“威严而沉默寡言的老爸”和“勤劳而坚韧不拔的老妈”转变。", "char_start": 1431, "char_end": 1501}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这就像蝌蚪到日子会变成青蛙一样自然。", "char_start": 1502, "char_end": 1520}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "五千年文明，岂是如此好相与的？", "char_start": 1521, "char_end": 1536}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "也正是因为中国文化这种微妙的安排，导致中国一旦遇到生死存亡的威胁，就会有大量已经完成生育的成年男女仿佛命不值钱一样如潮水般地身赴国难。而且一旦超脱了生死执着，这些定意为子孙后代牺牲的中年男女堪称世界上最理想的兵源、工匠和领袖，再凭借充足的人口生产，这就是几千年来这个文明屹立不倒的最大保障之一。", "char_start": 1537, "char_end": 1684}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "难道你只想享受五千年道统不绝、文明永续的福利，却指望不付出这份代价？", "char_start": 1685, "char_end": 1719}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "哪有这等好事？", "char_start": 1720, "char_end": 1727}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "现在真正的问题其实反而不是“为什么老夫老妻会没有性激情”，而是“为什么老夫老妻没有性激情会成为一个问题”。", "char_start": 1728, "char_end": 1781}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "几千年来这一直不是一个问题，甚至是一个被期待、被肯定的安排，何以现在却成了一个问题？", "char_start": 1782, "char_end": 1824}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "这是因为资本主义文明对“消费欲望”这种社会资源的无限需求。", "char_start": 1825, "char_end": 1854}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你当了祖宗，你就成了神了，神是没有欲望的。", "char_start": 1855, "char_end": 1876}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "你们不是常常自我调侃“已经很多年没给自己买过新衣服，没有换过新手机、新车了”吗？你们是带着愤怒和委屈说这话，还是带着隐隐的炫耀和骄傲在说？", "char_start": 1877, "char_end": 1946}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "你发现没有，这样自嘲着的老爸老妈们多是后者。", "char_start": 1947, "char_end": 1969}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "ta们在蜕变成祖宗，ta们的欲望在神性发育中自然消退了。这对把消费欲望当作血液和呼吸的资本主义文化是生死攸关的危机。", "char_start": 1970, "char_end": 2028}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你们都无欲无求了，我如何进一步扩大生产和销售？不持续维持生产和销售，我如何利用经济循环富集社会资源和权力？", "char_start": 2029, "char_end": 2082}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "所以，在资本主义文明主导的阶段，纵欲主义、物质主义、消费主义一直是被反复高举的新教义。是在这个时代背景下，中国人出现了“这样不正常”的自我怀疑。", "char_start": 2083, "char_end": 2155}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "这就是这背后的整个故事。", "char_start": 2156, "char_end": 2168}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "你看明白了，该选哪边，还是看你自己。", "char_start": 2169, "char_end": 2187}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 43, "quote": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0498"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：老公宁愿自己动手也不找我是为什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043"], "summary": "围绕“寡欲”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“中国夫妇——甚至可以说中国人——在性方面长期活跃、有旺盛需求其实是很罕见的，尤其是在中国，这差不多是凤毛麟角的现象。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "中国夫妇——甚至可以说中国人——在性方面长期活跃、有旺盛需求其实是很罕见的，尤其是在中国，这差不多是凤毛麟角的现象。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 58, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "59097971-cd3b-5407-93c9-809f6abbae38", "source_ordinal": 581, "reading_ordinal": 3476, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "希波克拉底", "published_at": "2025-09-12T18:58:24.675000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/4c293a3e8fc711f0bad152540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你知道哪类人活得最久么？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "恰恰不是那种肌肉胀鼓鼓、八百年不去一次医院的“阳光棒小伙”。", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "而恰恰是这种早年生了一种预后良好、有复发概率、早期发现可以很好的处置、然而一旦忽视后果严重的大病的人。", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 95}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "为啥？", "char_start": 96, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为这柄达摩克利斯之剑悬在头顶上，ta不敢在健康问题上开任何玩笑。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "ta很容易听从“别抽烟、别喝酒、早点睡、多运动、少吃腌腊食品……”等等健康建议，老老实实过规律作息的健康生活。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "然而这并不是这类人长寿的主因。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 205}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "长寿的主因有三个——", "char_start": 206, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "1）以健康为绝对优先的价值观可以帮助人避免很多不必要的过度冒险——例如“健康换事业”。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 260}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这还不是单纯指健康换事业的思路天然的不好，而是指健康换事业的人往往搞一些压力极大的冒险，然后在紧要关头——其实“紧要关头”了n年了，就没有不“紧要关头”过——健康突然崩溃，譬如一头栽倒人事不知，醒过来合同已经违约了、仓位已经强平了、公司已经破产清算了。", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 387}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "明知自己身体不健康、有重大隐患，作一作真的会死的人，不容易干这种大碗喝酒、大秤分金的事。", "char_start": 388, "char_end": 432}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "2）这类从鬼门关被退货回来的人更有“一期一会”的良好心态。", "char_start": 433, "char_end": 462}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "没事不出恶语，因为恐怕鞋脱了就会穿不上，那样说的最后一句话就永远是恶语了。", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 500}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "做事总要有完整记录，做好随时移交的准备，因为下周一没准就要去住院，不要害了同事和客户。", "char_start": 501, "char_end": 544}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "一个有明确风险意识的人，办事会大幅的倾向有头有尾，因为都是“办后事”，这会导致ta们很少积累压力，真正接近“当日事当日毕”，心理上处在一个“夕死可矣”的状态。", "char_start": 545, "char_end": 624}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这反而是一个极其健康的、放松的状态。", "char_start": 625, "char_end": 643}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "3）这些人长期被“死亡阴影”缠绕，心里早已做好了一切准备，因此一般的坏消息不容易造成多大打击。", "char_start": 644, "char_end": 691}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "四十岁棒小伙突然栽倒发现得了骨癌要切一条腿，腿切完了很多都直接陷入抑郁症，反而很容易寻短见。", "char_start": 692, "char_end": 738}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "所以，类似这种“男朋友得了早期肠癌治好了”“女朋友得了早期乳腺癌治好了”其实不是坏消息，而是好消息，因为这一种“退火”“种牛痘”式的幸运。", "char_start": 739, "char_end": 808}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "当然，这会导致你的后代罹患同样病症的概率比较大，但既然知道有家族史，自然会年年坚持筛查，以现在的技术，其实这反而比自诩金刚不坏、到了五十岁发现肝癌第三期要好得多。", "char_start": 809, "char_end": 890}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "总而言之，祸兮福所倚。", "char_start": 891, "char_end": 902}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "达摩克利斯就是希波克拉底。", "char_start": 903, "char_end": 916}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0498"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：男友患癌3A期，未来我们该何去何从？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“希波克拉底”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你知道哪类人活得最久么？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你知道哪类人活得最久么？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3bb65692-06d9-5c1d-9845-b42729a0ee27", "source_ordinal": 580, "reading_ordinal": 3477, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "识于微时", "published_at": "2025-09-13T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/9c93b2d88a7711f0884952540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "一般家长看人的优缺点是按能力看的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "按照多少米每秒、一分钟多少个、一小时几公斤、一口气多少下这类生产力参数来考虑人的优缺点的。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这本质上是在考虑人的工具性，在考虑人的“性能”，在考虑人有什么“用”，根据这个“用处”来考虑人的优劣。", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为ta自己本人就在被“市场”这样比量，所以ta就免不了用同样的思路去审视子女。", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这样审视，一个小孩子，你指望ta一秒跑几米？一口气游多远？一担挑几斤？一晚上做多少个？", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这样看当然“毫无优点”。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 213}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但小孩子的优缺点不是这样看的——甚至可以说人本身的优缺点都不应该这样看。", "char_start": 214, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "人的优点永远都首先体现在品质上。", "char_start": 251, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "谦虚、谨慎、开朗、宽容、勇敢、敏感、机智、皮实、坚强、镇定、善良、好奇、勤劳……", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这些品质的东西才成其为人类的优点。", "char_start": 309, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这些品质要辅以恰当的软件才能转换成那些用功率、速度、容积、个数衡量的能力，转换成良好性能。", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "没有凑齐这些条件，没有成功转化成这种效能，并不足以否定这些优良品质的存在。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 410}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这里就有人间最大的魔鬼——有大量的父母会因为最终没有看到那些良好性能，跳过“需要足够的条件”这个要害，直接倒推并断言子女没有相应的品质。", "char_start": 411, "char_end": 479}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "然后子女会信。", "char_start": 480, "char_end": 487}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "信了，这个品质就真的泯灭了。", "char_start": 488, "char_end": 502}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "泯灭了，以后条件再齐备，也无法再催化出两者兼备所能生成的那种卓越表现了。", "char_start": 503, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "父母仅仅从子女的工具性表现来倒推子女的品质，而又不自觉的按照成人水平标准来给子女评级，结果就几乎数学必然的推出子女一无所长，进而在品质上一无是处。", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你真要用这个方法也不是完全不行，那就需要把子女面对的各种客观挑战都纳入考量，去思考在ta这也不懂、那也不知道，这个也不会、那个也没见识过的前提下，ta的表现是否达标。", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 697}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "但更聪明的做法，是盲目的相信子女必有天赋，从不寻找ta有多糟糕的证据，仅仅只寻找ta有多优秀的证据。", "char_start": 698, "char_end": 748}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "注意，这不是叫你脑补，叫你幻想。你仍然需要找到不容否定的客观证据，基于无可质疑的严谨逻辑去证实那个品质的存在。", "char_start": 749, "char_end": 804}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你只是需要相信——那些品质必然存在。", "char_start": 805, "char_end": 823}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "因为上天造人时，默认就把这些品质嵌入到了每一个人心中，而且对绝大多数人而言甚至是完整的、全面的。", "char_start": 824, "char_end": 872}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "人类幼儿天生有人类所梦想的一切美德，只有极少数真的有遗传突变问题的个体会缺少其中的几样。而即使是这样的变异个体，也只是缺了那么几样而已，绝谈不上完全没有。", "char_start": 873, "char_end": 950}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "大多数幼儿是拥有全部美好的品质的，区别只在于各自突出的具体科目不同。有的倾向敏感机智，有的倾向勇敢宽容，而这些差异与其说是精神内核有差异，不如说是因为生理条件的差异造成的——敏感机智的是因为听觉、视觉、嗅觉格外灵敏，因而从外界获取的信息更丰富，更早的刺激了危机应对机制的发育；而勇敢宽容的那些则是因为痛觉阈值更高，从而更容易积极的探索环境并保持开放心态。", "char_start": 951, "char_end": 1128}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这并不是因为人类的最初心智的种子有多大的差异，而是因为这心智的种子种在了不同的肉体容器里，对身体形成了适应。", "char_start": 1129, "char_end": 1183}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "那颗种子里是先天嵌有一切美德——或者说从遗传选择而来的一切必要的社会性萌芽——的。", "char_start": 1184, "char_end": 1225}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "开玩笑，你算算，到你这一代，ta已经穿越了数百万年的社会选择，其中任何一代被所有的社群在生育前放逐，ta都不会出生，你还需要多强大的证据来证明这数万代先祖全都通过了社会性筛选的种子有足够的社会性？", "char_start": 1226, "char_end": 1324}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这不需要你有什么超然的信仰，你只需要承认和接受最朴素的现实就行了——现在每一个出生的儿童，都是数万代群居生活筛选的结果，而且是全C+以上的成绩。因为只要有一代是C-，ta都不可能存在。", "char_start": 1325, "char_end": 1417}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你有什么资格去否定这种精选种子的品质？", "char_start": 1418, "char_end": 1437}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "要你去找到能证实这种子的优良品质的客观证据，这真的应该是一个很困难的问题吗？", "char_start": 1438, "char_end": 1476}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "找不到，是这颗种子不行的概率大，还是你眼瞎心盲、心不在焉的概率大？", "char_start": 1477, "char_end": 1510}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "其实说穿了，父母教育子女最根本的手段就是及时抓取这些无可辩驳的证据，永久性的证实子女的品质。证据不灭失，你们这些认证不动摇，子女就会正确认知自己的优良性，并在这个基础之上自然伸展发育出必要的性能表现，因为尽管要有土壤——也就是前文所说的刺激品质种子发育成能力之花的条件——但这之中稀缺的总是种子，而不是土壤本身。", "char_start": 1511, "char_end": 1667}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "至少，在这个生产力高度发达、物质足够丰富的时代，这种条件是史上空前的丰沛。", "char_start": 1668, "char_end": 1705}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "做好这个见证，坚固子女对自身品质的信心，然后看家庭条件给予品质发育成能力的土壤，这基本就概括了你的教育策略。", "char_start": 1706, "char_end": 1760}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "而且坦率讲，只要你做好了第一步，让你的子女有坚实的证据相信自己的谦虚、谨慎、开朗、宽容、勇敢、敏感、机智、皮实、坚强、镇定、善良、好奇、勤劳……之中的随便几样甚至哪怕一样，你都干成了。", "char_start": 1761, "char_end": 1853}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "奇货可居者，在识于微时。", "char_start": 1854, "char_end": 1866}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 36}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0498"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为何我看不到孩子的优点？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036"], "summary": "围绕“识于微时”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“一般家长看人的优缺点是按能力看的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "一般家长看人的优缺点是按能力看的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
